Wait, game over in the 10th frame:
- After 1st roll: never over (always need at least one more).
- After 2nd roll: over if 1st < 10 (open or spare → spare needs a bonus; open is over). Actually: if 1st < 10 and 1st+2nd < 10 → over. If 1st < 10 and 1st+2nd == 10 (spare) → need bonus. If 1st == 10 → need 2nd bonus.
- After 3rd roll: always over.

So: game_over = (len(t) == 3) or (len(t) == 2 and t[0] < 10 and t[0] + t[1] < 10).

